          "content": "\u003c!-- FULL WIDTH BANNER --\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FF7F5C 0%, #FF8C42 100%);\n                padding: 16px 30px;\n                color: #2C2C2C;\n                box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\"\u003e\n        \n        \u003c!-- Max Width Container --\u003e\n        \u003cdiv style=\"max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto;\"\u003e\n            \n            \u003c!-- Main Warning Header --\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 14px\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\"font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #2C2C2C;\"\u003e\n                    This is a template with sample data\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\"font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.3; color: #2C2C2C;\"\u003e\n                   Service Health: Real-time visibility into the four golden signals of monitoring\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \n            \u003c!-- Steps - Horizontal Layout with Equal Widths --\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: stretch; justify-content: center; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto;\"\u003e\n                \n                \u003c!-- Step 1 --\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n                            color: #2C2C2C;\n                            padding: 12px;\n                            border-radius: 10px;\n                            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n                            flex: 1;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            display: flex;\n                            flex-direction: column;\n                            min-height: 50px;\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv style=\"background: white;\n                                   color: #2C2C2C;\n                                   width: 24px;\n                                   height: 24px;\n                                   min-width: 24px;\n                                   flex-shrink: 0;\n                                   border-radius: 6px;\n                                   display: flex;\n                                   align-items: center;\n                                   justify-content: center;\n                                   font-weight: 700;\n                                   font-size: 0.88rem;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #2C2C2C; line-height: 1.3;\"\u003eReplace Data Source\u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \n                \u003c!-- Step 2 --\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n                            color: #2C2C2C;\n                            padding: 12px;\n                            border-radius: 10px;\n                            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n                            flex: 1;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            display: flex;\n                            flex-direction: column;\n                            min-height: 50px;\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;\"\u003e\n                        \u003cdiv style=\"background: white;\n                                   color: #2C2C2C;\n                                   width: 24px;\n                                   height: 24px;\n                                   min-width: 24px;\n                                   flex-shrink: 0;\n                                   border-radius: 6px;\n                                   display: flex;\n                                 